{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your kingdom. Command your power. Rule the night \u2014 in Balathrone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, combine, and conquer in this unique blend of <strong>card strategy</strong>, <strong>city building</strong>, and <strong>kingdom defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, choose from three building cards \u2014 <strong>walls</strong>, <strong>towers</strong>, <strong>barracks</strong>, or <strong>magical cores</strong> \u2014 and decide your realm\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Master the Art of Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange your cards into powerful patterns to unleash devastating effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lines multiply your attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosses chain multiple strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squares boost defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triangles trigger magic or summon allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/f5df74af59e9315a39ddd9e64dde3694.poster.avif?t=1768650913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/f5df74af59e9315a39ddd9e64dde3694.webm?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/f5df74af59e9315a39ddd9e64dde3694.mp4?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Upgrade and Dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your empire by upgrading your buildings \u2014 each upgrade expands your power and reshapes your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/9224577c6f264f3a712b4c67d4811806.poster.avif?t=1768650913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/9224577c6f264f3a712b4c67d4811806.webm?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/9224577c6f264f3a712b4c67d4811806.mp4?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Unleash the Power of Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn your enemies, freeze their forces, or protect your towers with powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spell can turn the tide of battle in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/998e45e57197413fae755eeeb0c983a7.poster.avif?t=1768650913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/998e45e57197413fae755eeeb0c983a7.webm?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/998e45e57197413fae755eeeb0c983a7.mp4?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Survive the Night</strong><br><br>When night falls, endless waves of invaders attack your kingdom.<br>Only your strategy, spell cards, and clever placements can lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash firestorms, shield your towers, and freeze your enemies as you rise to rule the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your kingdom. Command your power. Rule the night \u2014 in <i>Balathrone</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Add to your wishlist and prepare for battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100170?t=1768650913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/ad7e48cca2a2fbe74783759c3340ebd9f8f30692/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768650913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/4b8eddd1316a558a289a881dcd41cfd52e84bb5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768650913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/4b8eddd1316a558a289a881dcd41cfd52e84bb5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768650913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your kingdom. Command your power. Rule the night \u2014 in Balathrone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, combine, and conquer in this unique blend of <strong>card strategy</strong>, <strong>city building</strong>, and <strong>kingdom defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, choose from three building cards \u2014 <strong>walls</strong>, <strong>towers</strong>, <strong>barracks</strong>, or <strong>magical cores</strong> \u2014 and decide your realm\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Master the Art of Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange your cards into powerful patterns to unleash devastating effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lines multiply your attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosses chain multiple strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squares boost defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triangles trigger magic or summon allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/f5df74af59e9315a39ddd9e64dde3694.poster.avif?t=1768650913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/f5df74af59e9315a39ddd9e64dde3694.webm?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/f5df74af59e9315a39ddd9e64dde3694.mp4?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Upgrade and Dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your empire by upgrading your buildings \u2014 each upgrade expands your power and reshapes your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/9224577c6f264f3a712b4c67d4811806.poster.avif?t=1768650913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100170/extras/9224577c6f264f3a712b4c67d4811806.webm?t=1768650913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sha